the bot should register and track participants who will take BDS training and certify them when they finish
For this purpose, I would recommend building a Telegram-based Training Management and Certification System integrated with WordPress.

This is more than a normal Telegram notification bot. You need a system that manages the entire participant journey, from registration to training completion and certification.

For your BDS (Business Development Services) training, I would structure it like this:

1. How the system should work
Step 1
Participant registration

Participant opens the Telegram bot and submits their name, phone number, organization and other required details.

Step 2
Participant enrollment

The system generates a unique participant ID and records their enrollment in WordPress.

Step 3
Training tracking

Tracks attendance, modules completed, assessments and progress.

Step 4
Assessment and verification

Checks whether participants meet the required completion and assessment criteria.

Step 5
Certificate issuance

Generates a certificate with the participant's name, unique certificate number and verification QR code.

